OL,3,ATrump waives several Russia sanctions
OL,4,Aas row with Zelensky intensifies
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian envoy Kirill Dmitriev said
OL,7,FTrump's order was "an important and
OL,8,Ftruly historic moment", and that the
OL,9,Fsanctions would have inflicted "serious
OL,10,Fdamage" on the US and global market.
